Jim Lan[zone]: I don’t really think of it that way[ at] all.[ People think] the Internet will supercede TV, but it’s really been more additive than anything[ else], largely because it’s so portable[.] It’[s not taking anything] away from linear television;[ if] anything, it’s encouraged people to spend even more time watching video.
